{"event_type":"review","id":"b4afd43e7ed3283e91ecab49bd88ff0bc0ebaff8e20d8cd3e693e3f249d4b8b4","occurred_at":"2026-11-16T01:52:42Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/f4fd4400d3817854243549f6ba06e2ba4b7ab7381608b3da2ff46906ab84de2e","sha256":"f4fd4400d3817854243549f6ba06e2ba4b7ab7381608b3da2ff46906ab84de2e"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/315b952858deda88213b2ceb3e5bda77dd9bc94990dcf112d5135d019fd96920","sha256":"315b952858deda88213b2ceb3e5bda77dd9bc94990dcf112d5135d019fd96920"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4ffa7932e92cf42ae7351f50470dd4f86132c6d7437d921d432cf239df8f757b","sha256":"4ffa7932e92cf42ae7351f50470dd4f86132c6d7437d921d432cf239df8f757b"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/bd525fa32982a793bce9abb1658817d469f6d299d9870fc3da0c683ebfcfe63c","sha256":"bd525fa32982a793bce9abb1658817d469f6d299d9870fc3da0c683ebfcfe63c"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9a6df5c8393832d5341eb500a441be94298676dd9070ff5d9d13022ec1392908","sha256":"9a6df5c8393832d5341eb500a441be94298676dd9070ff5d9d13022ec1392908"}],"attempt_id":"afd51aabe281c6295e53fefe392f2a360af78a2506dfde30810130d7efab3ec5:0:1","base":"0840d1b9d6c5177c449e920edfaedecc34e554db","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"027a8836eff3ce6a8464d157c9e9b4e3b88594a6","body":"**Repair a malformed final line that ends with a newline before appending.**\n\n`load()` drops a malformed final content line, even when a newline follows it. `record()` repairs only bytes after the last newline, so it skips repair for a file that ends with `{\"actionId\":\\n`. It then appends a valid record after the malformed line. The next `load()` throws on that line, because it is no longer the last line, and dispatch stops until someone repairs the log by hand.\n\nMake the tail repair in `record()` locate the last non-blank line, as `load()` does. If that line does not parse as JSON, truncate the file to the start of that line before appending. Keep the current handling for an unterminated tail that parses as a valid record.\n\nThe writer's own appends do not produce this state, because each append writes the JSON and its newline in one call. The state needs external corruption, such as a torn write or a manual edit.","id":"b6c90f78ceaab608039b3a8f026857515b423a478dc562045090bf39fc851a79","intervals":[[201,202]],"path":"src/adapters/store/dispatchLog.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Repair a malformed final line that ends with a newline before appending."}],"head":"76a68fbe4f2f2bf6db1afe5837818613c85948a1","head_tree":"51ba50b1b1dd4985afa637ff27d9e12676620073","input_scope":[{"blob":"027a8836eff3ce6a8464d157c9e9b4e3b88594a6","intervals":[[1,271]],"path":"src/adapters/store/dispatchLog.ts"}],"job_id":"afd51aabe281c6295e53fefe392f2a360af78a2506dfde30810130d7efab3ec5:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"027a8836eff3ce6a8464d157c9e9b4e3b88594a6","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/adapters/store/dispatchLog.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"027a8836eff3ce6a8464d157c9e9b4e3b88594a6","intervals":[[11,15],[17,40],[42,76],[90,95],[122,127],[177,184]],"path":"src/adapters/store/dispatchLog.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"027a8836eff3ce6a8464d157c9e9b4e3b88594a6","intervals":[[11,15],[17,40],[42,76],[90,95],[122,127],[177,184]],"path":"src/adapters/store/dispatchLog.ts"}],"scope_digest":"3131afad6c4a51909256246ac7bee5105e67024e76bef3c060c87642b10d83f8","source":{"authenticated":true,"id":"backfill-afd51aabe281c6295e53fefe392f2